  "title": "Hydrogen-Powered GR Corolla Takes on World-First Challenge at Super Taikyu Fuji 24 Hours Race",
  "summary": "Toyota Motor Corporation (Toyota) will compete in the ENEOS Super Taikyu Series 2026 Empowered by BRIDGESTONE Round 3 NAPAC Fuji 24 Hours Race, taking place on June 5 and 6, with the #32 TGRR GR Corolla H2 concept (the liquid hydrogen-powered GR Corolla), which runs on liquid hydrogen and will become the world's first race car equipped with a superconducting liquid hydrogen pump to compete in a race.",
